==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Sinner Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*2 [[Condemned Peng]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 30~33.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Tackey]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Condemned Peng]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Any decent midranger can carry this stage alongside a meatshield, just make sure Condemned Pengs don't stack up.

